<title>POLAND: Sokolow Q2 net falls to PLN 2.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Sokolow Q2 net falls to PLN 2.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sokolow preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.65 vs	4.38</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.10 vs	4.79</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.96 vs	3.16</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Sokolowskie Zaklady MIesne Sokolow SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 69.17 vs     55.10</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  59.70 vs     45.38</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.14 vs	1.64</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.01 vs	5.64</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.55 vs	5.24</p>
<p>    investment				10.34 vs     11.83</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 6.03 vs	6.11</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   5.22 vs	6.70</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.73 vs	4.26</p>
<p>    net sales				129.59 vs    106.49</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 110.35 vs     89.37</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.49 vs	2.44</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.79 vs	5.99</p>
<p>    financial costs			  3.60 vs	5.40</p>
<p>    investment				11.52 vs     12.79</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
